        "text": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We designed Voxblock for children. It had to be simple enough for a three-year-old to choose a story and play it on their own, with no screen and nothing to set up. Most of the people who buy it are still families.</p><p>What we learnt is that the things that make it easy for a small child make it easy for anyone: one book at a time, a play button that glows, and nothing to log in to. More and more, people are buying it for a parent or grandparent, or for themselves.</p><p><a href=\"/\" title=\"Voxblock for children\">See Voxblock for children →</a></p>"
