          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the easiest way for an elderly person to listen to audiobooks?",
            "content": "<p>A player that needs no screen, no wi-fi and no account. With Voxblock, each audiobook is a block: put it on the player and press play. The player remembers where you stopped.</p>",
